>>Does anyone have a plausible scenario for an early upload attempt that
>>allows more than one try?
>
> I am hoping for something like what Vinge hinted at in True Names - a
>direct digital connection to the nervous system, via which my personality
>would migrate over a period of years as I relied on it increasingly to
